TEXT -1552 420 Left 2 !.tran 0 300u 0 50n
TEXT -1552 452 Left 2 !.param Vin=1m Vth=0.35
TEXT -1552 484 Left 2 ;.ac dec 200 1k 10Meg
TEXT -1552 516 Left 2 ;ADVANCED RX: 4th-order Butterworth BPF as 2 staggered MFB sections (f0=200k BW=80k):
TEXT -1552 548 Left 2 ;MFB1 f01=173.5k Q=3.57 (R1=4.87k R2=19.6k R3=422, C=330p) / MFB2 f02=230.6k Q=3.57 (3.74k/15.0k/316)
TEXT -1552 580 Left 2 ;section gain 2.02 each -> combined 2.0 at 200kHz. Out-of-band: -23dBc@400k vs -12dBc (single MFB).
TEXT -1552 612 Left 2 ;Input protection: R_IN=100 (clamp current limit) + 1N4148 rail clamp + R_IN2=1k (opamp pin current limit).
TEXT -1552 644 Left 2 ;Rest of chain same as RX_improved: x20 -> BPF(x2) -> x25 = 60dB, BAT54 envelope tau=15us, comparator+1Meg hys.
TEXT -1552 676 Left 2 ;GBW check: MFB needs ~20*Q^2*f0 = 51MHz -> use OPA607(50MHz) per section; margin thin, verified by sim.
